+
+## Release 1.0.1
+
+Version 1.0.1 is built in `/var/www/Netory_DIST/1.0.1` from the current main application. Run its `Netory-Setup.exe` directly on a 1.0 machine and choose **Update Netory**; uninstalling first is unnecessary. Setup discovers the existing paths from `HKLM\Software\Netory`, preserves accounts/passwords, encryption configuration, network/HTTPS settings and licensing identity, and migrates the original `0043_notes_board` database through `0046_report_configurations`. The package version is recorded in `version.json`, manifest metadata and Windows installed apps.
+
+Build with `--version 1.0.1` and use the separate cache `/var/www/Netory_DIST/build-support/downloads-1.0.1`. The public license-authority certificate is included; private license keys and live data are excluded. An older installation without an application license may require activation after upgrading. Data migration and actual archived-1.0 bootstrap preservation are exercised on Linux; GUI, Windows service, firewall and rollback lifecycle still require a Windows test machine.
